    "detailed_description": "Branded as traitors for revealing a genocidal plot to eliminate a peaceful species for their resources, your pilots Darius, Lana, Abeni, and Pablo must struggle to survive nearly endless waves of attacking ships from The Empire.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nTake out what enemies you can as you upgrade your ship's weaponry and defensive capabilities in the hope of surviving long enough to make your escape.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nChoose among different pilots and ships with varying abilities and weaponry in this sci-fi themed survivorslike. Evade a variety of enemy ships with different configurations and attack types, including heavily-armed battleships. With enough skill, you can save our heroes from certain doom.",
    "about_the_game": "Branded as traitors for revealing a genocidal plot to eliminate a peaceful species for their resources, your pilots Darius, Lana, Abeni, and Pablo must struggle to survive nearly endless waves of attacking ships from The Empire.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nTake out what enemies you can as you upgrade your ship's weaponry and defensive capabilities in the hope of surviving long enough to make your escape.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nChoose among different pilots and ships with varying abilities and weaponry in this sci-fi themed survivorslike. Evade a variety of enemy ships with different configurations and attack types, including heavily-armed battleships. With enough skill, you can save our heroes from certain doom.",
